{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-758b3e5e2eb2","section":null,"index":1,"text":"<h3 align=\"center\">\n\tFlexoki Dark Flavor for <a href=\"https://github.com/sxyazi/yazi\">Yazi</a>\n</h3>"}
{"op":"section.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-758c934fa669","parent":null,"index":2,"title":"👀 Preview"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-758d394a1d31","section":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-758c934fa669","index":0,"text":"<img src=\"preview.png\" width=\"600\" />"}
{"op":"section.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-758ef70a7e29","parent":null,"index":3,"title":"🎨 Installation"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-758fc82edd17","section":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-758ef70a7e29","index":0,"text":"```sh\nya pkg add gosxrgxx/flexoki-dark\n```"}
{"op":"section.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-7590a07fd0b3","parent":null,"index":4,"title":"⚙️ Usage"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-759189132f6b","section":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-7590a07fd0b3","index":0,"text":"To set it as your dark flavor, change the content of your `theme.toml` to:"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-7592090c2175","section":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-7590a07fd0b3","index":1,"text":"```toml\n[flavor]\ndark = \"flexoki-dark\"\n```"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-75935bf78d18","section":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-7590a07fd0b3","index":2,"text":"Make sure your `theme.toml` doesn't contain anything other than `[flavor]`, unless you want to override certain styles of this flavor."}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-75942d68c472","section":"01a122be-08d5-7780-bd8a-7590a07fd0b3","index":3,"text":"See the [Yazi flavor documentation](https://yazi-rs.github.io/docs/flavors/overview) for more details."}
